  "description": "Fuaran.MVU: a model-update-view runtime whose components are pure, whose effects are values, and whose message loop decides each step whole before it installs anything. The step machine and its gate are held to F* models by a differential test on .NET and under Fable. Depends on Fuaran.MVU.Kernel, FSharp.Core and the published Fuaran.Core.Function and Fuaran.Core.AiSurface packages.",
